  "description": "The king, Naru, who lost his kingdom in exchange for rejecting Emperor Lee Cheong's proposal.  \nIn the northern forest, where he has run away with shame, he meets a stranger, Hoan.  \nNaru recovers body and mind with Hoan's care, but... .  \nThe days of revenge are getting closer and the love affair is getting more and more intertwined.  \nWill Naru be able to protect her love and the throne? (by Google Translate)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=787463), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8023339)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002054)",
